<title>USA: BOXING-CERMENO RETAINS WBA JUNIOR FEATHERWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-CERMENO RETAINS WBA JUNIOR FEATHERWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Antonio Cermeno of Venezuela retained his World Boxing Association junior featherweight title on Saturday by stopping Eddie Saenz of Nicaragua, who failed to answer the bell for the sixth round.</p>
</text>
